   <property name="text">
    <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Menu Bar:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;- &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;Under File, you can save or load a project, or start a new project&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;- Under Edit, you can undo and redo actions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;- Under Frame, you can add or remove frames from the project, or clear a frame&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Tools:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;- Using the freehand Paint Brush and the Eraser, you can edit the canvas to your liking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;- You can draw shapes using Line, Square, or Circle&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;- You can change the magnification of the Preview window using the Zoom and Reset buttons&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;- You can change the color and opacity of your drawings using the Color button&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Preview&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;- The preview window displays the frames of your animated sprite&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;- You can change the speed of the preview using the FPS slider below the window&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;- You can select and see the frames of your sprite under the FPS slider&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
   </property>
   <property name="alignment">
    <set>Qt::AlignmentFlag::AlignLeading|Qt::AlignmentFlag::AlignLeft|Qt::AlignmentFlag::AlignTop</set>
   </property>
  </widget>
